usage: corpus-nav.py semantic [-h] [--limit LIMIT] [--build-index]
                              [--model MODEL] [--tfidf] [--threads THREADS]
                              [query]

positional arguments:
  query              natural-language query string

options:
  -h, --help         show this help message and exit
  --limit, -n LIMIT  number of top results to show (default: 15)
  --build-index      embed changed blocks into tools/.corpus-index/ (needs
                     fastembed)
  --model MODEL      fastembed model (default: $CORPUS_NAV_MODEL or BAAI/bge-
                     small-en-v1.5)
  --tfidf            force the stdlib TF-IDF ranking
  --threads THREADS  ONNX/OMP threads (default: $CORPUS_NAV_THREADS, else
                     $OMP_NUM_THREADS, else min(4, CPUs))
